arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i><b>Sample Scales of Smoke</b></i></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Clipping the Darkened Wing</i></span><br /> <b>Prerequisite Coils:</b> Summon the Parliament<br /> <b>Procedure:</b> The subject has to be a vessel with a Vitae pool, such as a vampire or a ghoul. The dragon prepares a mixture using one point of Vitae and various esoteric oils. The resulting solution is then injected into the subject.<br /> <b>Effect:</b> The subject gains one Vitae, along with the risk of the blood bond. This specific Vitae is tracked separately on the character sheet. If the subject becomes possessed by a Strix while not having used up this Vitae, the Strix becomes trapped. Only through winning an opposed Shadow Potency roll against the Vitae donor\u2019s Blood Potency can the Strix end the possession. The Strix can only attempt dispossession once every 24 hours and, unlike an unpossessed vessel, can\u2019t use up the marked Vitae.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Donning the Formless Shroud</i></span><br /> <b>Prerequisite Coils:</b> Breath-Drinking<br /> <b>Procedure:</b> Lorem ipsum.<br /> <b>Effect:</b> The subject gains the Shadow Form of the Strix. She gains the three simplified Attributes Power, Finesse and Resistance, which is equal to her original Intelligence, Wits and Resolve respectively. She also gains Size according to the Shadow Potency table (p. 201), and updates her derived traits according to the rules of Strix. While in this form she does not gain access to her normal, blood-bound Vitae. Instead, all of her vampiric abilities needs to be powered by Shadow Vitae, as described above.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Consume the Shadow</i></span><br /> <b>Prerequisite Coils:</b> Shadow Mastery<br /> <b>Procedure:</b> Lorem ipsum.<br /> <b>Effect:</b> Unknown.<br /> No cases of performing this Scale has been documented, but the theorized outcome by the Scale\u2019s late creator was the successful diablerie of a Strix, gaining Blood Experience equal to the Strix\u2019 Shadow Potency, as well as gaining one new Dread Power that the Strix knew. If this is possible it would undoubtedly be a Breaking Point on par with diablerizing a vampire.<br /> <br /> <br /> Yes, I know that I haven't written two of the procedures, but I'm just not getting any inspiration for them. Any suggestions (or other kinds of feedback) are very welcome.<br /> <br /> Speaking of feedback:<br /> <br /> <br /> I really like the first two dots. They're messing with the vampire template in ways that are unexpected but not broken. I might use versions of those two dots for another hypothetical Coil of mine about messing with the concept of Humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I really think this is what I was looking for , thanks Tessie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T06:23:59-07:00","id":1141388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1141375#post1141375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really think this is what I was looking for , thanks Tessie.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you use those Scales in a game I'd be very glad to hear what procedures you came up with.<br /> <br /> Edit: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LTRTPPS4Mqt6Kl6eOo7C4HDJzL475F_WCcgEhn_ow_Q/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Here's</a> an updated document for those who'd like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":11887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","user":"Tessie","date":". 09-18-2017, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T07:12:14-07:00","id":1141395,"title":"","content":"on Omen Sensitivity, how do you think it would work for a Kindred trying to <i>prevent </i>a disaster?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T07:27:19-07:00","id":1141401,"title":"","content":"I think that it would continue to ping on the disaster until the Kindred has successfully taken steps to avoid it. Of course, if Fate dictates a disaster, it might throw a bait-and-switch. You stopped the bombing in your home town, but the sense is still pinging and within days a wildfire is ravaging the countryside. Another complication might be the disaster has already attracted Strix that are actively sabotaging you.<br /> <br /> Besides, someone who studies this Mystery will most likely not care about disasters unless they themselves feel threatened by it. Ordo's Mysteries are both utility and philosophy. If anything they would revel in the oncoming carnage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":11887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","user":"Tessie","date":". 09-19-2017, 03:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T17:53:28-07:00","id":1146203,"title":"","content":"Oh just had an idea? Would it be beyond reason for citys that allready suffer attention from the Strix to be the safest place for practicionars? <br /> <br /> As the prince might in desperation give these &quot;Scholar's of Strix Lore&quot; refuge, thinking their experiments couldnt make things worse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T19:55:10-07:00","id":1146224,"title":"","content":"Or the most dangerous, given Strix probably wouldn't be happy with being studied. At least, not without a price being paid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://for